ve_user":"<p>The following user account has been deleted from the system: Username: %user_login_deactive Email: %user_email_deactive Please review if any issues arise. Best regards,<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_verify_user":"","subject_mail_verify_user":"Account Verification","mail_verify_user":"<p>To verify your email address, please use the following One Time Password (OTP): %code_verify_user If you have any problems, please contact us.<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_pending_identify_for_user":"","subject_mail_pending_identify_for_user":"Account Verification","mail_pending_identify_for_user":"<p>Hi %user_login, Your identification is pending. Please wait for the admin to approve your identification. Best regards,<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_pending_identify_for_admin":"","subject_mail_pending_identify_for_admin":"Account Verification","mail_pending_identify_for_admin":"<p>Hi Admin, A user has submitted their identification for verification. Please review the information below: Username: %user_login Email: %user_email Before Image: %before_image After Image: %after_image Please take the necessary action to approve or reject the identification. Best regards,<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_approve_identify_for_user":"","subject_mail_approve_identify_for_user":"Account Verification","mail_approve_identify_for_user":"<p>Hi %user_login, Your identification has been approved.<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_approve_identify_for_admin":"","subject_mail_approve_identify_for_admin":"Account Verification","mail_approve_identify_for_admin":"<p>Hi Admin, Information of user who has been approved: Username: %user_login Email: %user_email<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_unverify_identify_for_user":"","subject_mail_unverify_identify_for_user":"Account Verification","mail_unverify_identify_for_user":"<p>Hi %user_login, Your identification has been rejected. Please contact us for more information.<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_unverify_identify_for_admin":"","subject_mail_unverify_identify_for_admin":"Account Verification","mail_unverify_identify_for_admin":"<p>Hi Admin, Information of user who has been rejected: Username: %user_login Email: %user_email<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_activated_package":"","subject_mail_activated_package":"Your purchase was activated","mail_activated_package":"<p>Welcome to %website_url and thank you for purchasing a plan with us. We are excited you have chosen %website_name . %website_name is a great jobs to advertise and search properties. You plan on %website_url activated! You can now list your properties according to you plan.<\/p>","jobportal_admin_mail_activated_package":"","subject_admin_mail_activated_package":"Your package has been purchased by 1 user","admin_mail_activated_package":"<p>We are excited to inform you that a user has successfully purchased your package! Here are the details:User Name: %your_name,User Email: %user_email,Package ID: %package_id<\/p>","jobportal_info_mail_candidate_apply":"","subject_mail_candidate_apply":"You have successfully applied on %website_url","mail_candidate_apply":"<p>Hi %user_apply, You have applied for 1 job on %website_url. Jobs Title: %jobs_apply Jobs Url: %jobs_url<\/p>","jobportal_info_mail_employer_apply":"","subject_mail_employer_apply":"There is 1 candidate applied for your job","mail_employer_apply":"<p>Your jobs on %website_url has been applied. Jobs Title: %jobs_apply Jobs Url: %jobs_url User Apply: %user_apply User Info: %user_url<\/p>","jobportal_info_mail_candidate_apply_nlogin":"","subject_mail_candidate_apply_nlogin":"There is 1 candidate applied for your job","mail_candidate_apply_nlogin":"<p>Your jobs on %website_url has been applied. Jobs Title: %jobs_apply Jobs Url: %jobs_url Message: %message<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_activated_listing":"","subject_mail_activated_listing":"Your purchase was activated","mail_activated_listing":"<p>Your purchase on %website_url is activated! You should go and check it out.<\/p>","jobportal_user_mail_approved_listing":"","subject_mail_a