ent request on %website_url ! Please follow the instructions below in order to start submitting properties as soon as possible. The invoice number is: %invoice_no, Amount: %total_price.<\/p>","jobportal_info_mail_notification_meetings":"","subject_mail_notification_meetings":"You have a notification about the meeting","mail_notification_meetings":"<p>There is a meeting coming up at %website_url! Job related meeting: %jobs_meetings! Time for the meeting to start %date_time.<\/p>","mail_footer_user":"<p>Do you need help? Contact us T. (00) 658 54332 E. hello@uxper.co \u00a9 2023 Uxper. All Right Reserved.<\/p>","custom_field_jobs":[{"label":"","id":"","field_type":"text","job_custom_field_sidebar_order":"0","select_choices":""}],"custom_field_company":[{"label":"","id":"","field_type":"text","select_choices":""}],"custom_field_candidate":[{"tabs":"new","section":"","label":"","id":"","field_type":"text","select_choices":""}]}
